<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>By Thy blood, Lord, I’ve been purchased;</l><l>Thou hast paid the highest price;</l><l>‘Tis the basis of my offering</l><l>As a living sacrifice.</l><l>I love Thee, for Thou first loved me;</l><l>As more love I daily see,</l><l>Thy love greatly motivates me</l><l>Willingly to live for Thee!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Yet, the service Thou desirest</l><l>Must not from my self be brought;</l><l>Thou wouldst have me open to Thee,</l><l>For Thy love’s work to be wrought.</l><l>In my heart, Thy home establish;</l><l>Reproduce Thyself in me;</l><l>Built with others in Thy Body,</l><l>For Thy service meet I’d be.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Lord, like Mary, to Thee listening,</l><l>At Thy feet, so lovingly,</l><l>Hearing Thy dear heart’s intention,</l><l>Revelation I’ll receive.</l><l>Lord, I break my flask, most precious;</l><l>My heart’s treasury outpour;</l><l>Fill Thy house with sweetest fragrance,</l><l>A memorial evermore!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
